_identity":"2cabf671bcde94ce30d703c370e9a7e73241659e4ffd34714b699094bf3e4c41","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The Commander of the G.E.M. this noble looking giant looks down upon you in contempt. She wields two huge rotating saws still covered in various horror entrails.","source_tag":"_t","target":"G.E.M.的指挥官。这个高贵的巨人用藐视的眼神居高临下地看着你。她手里拿着两个巨大的旋转圆锯，上面还带有恐魔的内脏。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4333087fe724b7fe69aea4b20f5356894e856119af5f50d5e9b853f7a13c92cc","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"2323348800c14a0135aa5721ead4a0b9ca4836a4fcdad032e2e13450704e79bd","logical_entry_identity":"a804965d7873a5a8742b728d89294b1c76b3f54e1aeba7778c0ee6ff9e388ece","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"elemental","source_tag":"entity type","target":"元素生物"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"de33a625fa195fd0bce7e2658fea2b6230c59c1dbae3d0a2d8117533b64cd52d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23528370bfb23bbf246dc31311302ae3682e7fbb685bc654b045020ef9017ffd","logical_entry_identity":"ab7e8be91e8fa104863ed14ee9252c7433d1f896c0587a6115a84d8f3bb4aecc","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#The Blood of Undeath strengthens your undead body (-60 maximum life, -140 minimum life).","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#CRIMSON#不死之血强化了你的不死之躯（-60最大生命值，-140生命值下限）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bc63f48056559bd70e9826a8ac008f9988316b82e3763fcf2308c7c6e44844bd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"235300d51e37de492d043da018043af18df652800241c765ee32a6d613193903","logical_entry_identity":"0b54f8011f33221422df3fe3a95df81bb6f51511f90899949aeb20a356136221","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Mow Down","source_tag":"talent name","target":"肢解"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7704df788cf1b2bba3a2a8f1faec3bfa4fbfc95ba3a8bfbc82890a5279f32f8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"2356f8b6505100dfe0d579127ede48cd3e730e774eae976163502fc86952517d","logical_entry_identity":"69778b48830d675c4c18e3c32733c56a9066c27ecfb808ee5dba93f8909efe9d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Fire out a spear of cosmic energies. If it hits an enemy it deals %0.2f damage, otherwise it explodes in a thin cone of radius %d at the end of its range, blocked by enemies, which deals %0.2f to %0.2f damage depending on how much the enemies block.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射一支宇宙能量长矛。若击中敌人，造成 %0.2f 点伤害；否则会在射程终点爆炸，形成半径 %d 的狭窄锥形区域。该效果会被敌人阻挡，并根据阻挡程度造成 %0.2f 到 %0.2f 点伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fc604f92f45d162aa2eb6aaa2283892f2a67f083140c5248ac7349bb4e4f342","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23a0a1329110662732a9768af0ccd643aa8354c29945bc702afc8ec6f4e8ada0","logical_entry_identity":"e5e4b16cb20cec2209662c0843abe3375176e9dc5cffa5befb96038a75074c15","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"steel steamsaw","source_tag":"entity name","target":"钢铁蒸汽链锯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"88690c1c64d9c0474444ffa00b0bb0f52c90559d6908ef0cf8e232955d9d21a7","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23a567e65addc0a17b72271298a5341e9a969b46b7bb06f9e1c52bb6d2e70b49","logical_entry_identity":"73988d6b9b446b1466a0588789f0a3fe60fcb2c7ddb1cc768a664ed3367f8955","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"place the bomb on the structural weakness.","source_tag":"_t","target":"将炸弹放在建筑的弱点处。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15f6f73302388e21e0631ea66cfff4e16d27e9770e4a5954af4987d25a32ea35","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23aa13087de32cea4ac3cfc794366e1875ebbefc8ad260470dc6c264905985ea","logical_entry_identity":"07544275a7018a96d155b2bb0221e0dd6eb6fe615db5d1155441c83ede943655","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The target is grappled by %s, pinning them, reducing attack, spell and mind speed by %d%% and subjecting them to an automatic tailsaw strike each turn for %d%% damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被 %s 抓取，被定身，降低战斗、法术和精神速度 %d%%，并每回合受到一次自动的尾部链锯打击，造成 %d%% 伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"83efdb46b1c09afa363eef742b8e4c128971421d10ef95c223d5496aa2d3234f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23aadef7d10a1078eac9bfcc07ca7c3955b9501c6951cf96907e37b24f0fd4d9","logical_entry_identity":"e667a8ae72ced1c3ee1460f7e4bbd19b43f7ca6f47fdcdee4be959aac0f324a6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You require two steamsaws for this talent.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要两把蒸汽链锯才能使用这一技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"89a3dd2dd4397420e0f329d6a0e2373a139741e449d12df38f89bf53e679e59b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23b49dfa0544f364496c2560341c077aa59e1dac181e5b5126564ab4250a177b","logical_entry_identity":"65841344d395a847d17357a39877af67076e506868d0fe073935a8cb1cf48f42","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Yetis Cave","source_tag":"_t","target":"雪人洞穴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec259997b0c4b881973c495b3ade97d3b957e91187da9dd2debea5497912f4f4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23e4d42cdbd3387c0eafa86d0972ff9a42f45cdf2b80f44ab1124f257eef0466","logical_entry_identity":"698f19798ea01f7fcfad346340205665d3a754ec70813c7c914815c295a1e9ab","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are a member of the prideful but dwindling Orc race.\n\nThroughout history your race has been hated, hunted and mercilessly killed by the others. It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions.\nBut now, the Orcs are on the brink of extinction. All their strongholds in Var'Eyal have been destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the #{italic}#Scourge of the West#{normal}#.\nOf the four Prides on the mainland none stood. They all fell and very few of their members were able to flee.\n\nOnly the Kruk Pride, stationed on the Clork Peninsula still stands, but for how long?\nThe Sunwall outpost blocks the way to the mainland and the peninsula itself is home to an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology.\n\nAnd now the giants have dug a tunnel through the mountains right into Kruk, pouring out of it to end the Pride once and for all while the bulk of Kruk forces are away.\nThey must be stopped at any cost, if Kruk falls the Orc race dies with it.\n\nYou grabbed a bomb from the stocks and now you must enter the tunnel and detonate it on a weak spot to make it crumble.\nFor the orcs, for Garkul's legacy !\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#。\n你是骄傲但逐渐凋零的兽人一族的成员。\n\n在历史的长河中，你的种族被人所憎恨、捕杀并残忍地杀害。你的种族也曾犯下许多暴行，造成无数破坏。\n但是现在，兽人已经到了灭绝的边缘。你们在瓦·埃亚尔所有的据点不是被太阳堡垒摧毁，就是被你们称作#{italic}#西方灾星#{normal}#的那个人摧毁。\n大陆上的四个部落不复存在。他们已经全部被击败，很少有成员有机会能够逃离。\n\n只有克拉克半岛的克鲁克部族依然挺立，但是他们还能坚持多久？\n太阳堡垒的前哨站堵住了通往大陆的道路，而半岛本身则居住着一个先进而好斗的巨人种族，掌握着蒸汽科技。\n\n现在，巨人从山脉中挖出了一条直通克鲁克的隧道，正从中涌出，要在克鲁克的大部分军队离开时一劳永逸地终结这个部落。\n必须不惜一切代价阻止他们；如果克鲁克沦陷，兽人种族也将随之灭亡。\n\n你从仓库中拿出一个炸弹，现在你必须进入隧道并在弱点引爆它使隧道崩溃。\n为了部落，为了加库尔的遗产！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aabcc7d4d7c5fee671a413763ab318e8026e2a2a48e1648fd7211abd88dbf315","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"23ff320cc9755fad7619bb5911232f3dc998b1a60ed035008e9c50fd73ac95b7","logical_entry_identity":"7f47e499b107e28d6a673203b806e0dbcd46c0e366ba79c5d1a7c627a1d3b8fd","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"+Bleeds","source_tag":"_t","target":"+流血"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"93932fdd43a99e643b845dc428bcb4ebdc4ff8ca6e5c220746ea90a6cfe90251","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"24019b8369573105f69aa24dbc5b595f5cf4d5ba81259076b39605eec4c39fff","logical_entry_identity":"14e98aafd2db7031702850aed54748e03cb3c842b587519cff547d01729cc070","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have stopped the pitiful Nektosh, ensuring one less threat for the Pride and a future for the Whitehooves.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你阻止了可怜的纳克托什，克鲁克部族从此少了一个威胁，白蹄族也因此有了未来。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"123a06dc9ca0da2458118c5c0d55cdc8a69f9cc0a077f6a565752ef3badbd23b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"24217b61cc2ae0d9acc26f88eabfe1f99baac742fa981f4d5124784f655a08f6","logical_entry_identity":"c07c94c7b68c